&gt; from 136pounds to 129pounds in keto in less than a week 

You do know that's inevitable at first on keto right? You burn up glucose in your system, which binds to water in a 1 to 4 ratio, and without that glucose you pee out the unbound water. Most people have 1-1.5 pounds of glucose stored in their body naturally, which means going keto is going to make you, on average, drop anywhere from like 5-10 pounds in the first week depending on how much glucose you had in your system. 

